      <span>If Brisa doesn't work for you in 30-days, we'll send you 3 weeks of cores FREE and book a 1-on-1 call to make sure it does. We don't stop until you've kicked the habit.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="brisa-product-area-info__trust-row" aria-label="Store benefits">
      <div class="brisa-product-area-info__trust-item">
        <span class="brisa-product-area-info__trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false">
            <path d="M7 30h25l6-9h3a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v5h-5" />
            <path d="M7 30V18h23v12" />
            <path d="M15 35a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8ZM36 35a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8Z" />
            <path d="M11 16h14M8 21h10M5 25h10" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span>Free shipping<br>PLUS ANY 2+U</span>
      </div>

      <div class="brisa-product-area-info__trust-item">
        <span class="brisa-product-area-info__trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false">
            <rect x="11" y="21" width="26" height="19" rx="3" />
            <path d="M17 21v-6a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v6" />
            <path d="M24 29v5" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span>Secure checkout</span>
      </div>

      <div class="brisa-product-area-info__trust-item">
        <span class="brisa-product-area-info__trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false">
            <path d="M8 20c5-7 11-7 16 0 5-7 11-7 16 0" />
            <path d="M8 29c5-7 11-7 16 0 5-7 11-7 16 0" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="37" r="3" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="37" r="3" />
            <circle cx="36" cy="37" r="3" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span>1,000+ Aussies on<br>Brisa</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="brisa-product-area-info__sellout">WE SOLD OUT FAST LAST TIME - GET IN QUICK AND ORDER NOW</div>

    <div class="brisa-product-area-info__panel brisa-product-area-info__panel--aroma">
      <h2 class="brisa-product-area-info__panel-heading">ENGINEERED FOR AROMA.</h2>
      <p class="brisa-product-area-info__panel-subheading">Built to deliver the ritual without the chemistry.</p>

      <div class="brisa-product-area-info__feature-list">
        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__feature">
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false">
              <path d="M40 7C21.5 8.5 10.5 17.5 9 35.5C18.5 37 30.5 31 35.5 21.5" />
              <path d="M9.5 36C15.5 25.5 23.5 19.5 35.5 16" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <p><strong>Food-grade aroma compounds.</strong> Built from natural fibres and food-grade aroma. The same scent profile, clean hand to mouth ritual without vaping or smoke.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__feature">
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false">
              <path d="M7 18h25c4 0 6-5 3-8-2.4-2-6-1-7 2" />
              <path d="M7 27h31c4 0 6 5 3 8-2.4 2-6 1-7-2" />
              <path d="M7 36h19" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <p><strong>Cool, clean draw.</strong> Delivers a familiar draw-like scent with zero hand-to-mouth separation. Just swap, pull, and satisfy. No smoke, no nicotine, no vapour.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__feature">
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false">
              <path d="M17 24V12.5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V23" />
              <path d="M23 22V9.5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V23" />
              <path d="M29 23V13a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v14" />
              <path d="M17 25 13.5 21.5a3 3 0 0 0-4.3 4.2l8.4 10.1A12 12 0 0 0 39 28v-8a3 3 0 0 0-6 0" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <p><strong>Full ritual replacement.</strong> Same motion. Same draw. Same throat sensation. The core does the sensory work - your hands do the rest.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__feature">
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" focusable="false">
              <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="17" />
              <path d="M17 17 31 31M31 17 17 31" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <p><strong>Drug-free, every time.</strong> Zero nicotine. Zero pharmaceuticals. Zero combustion. Just the ritual, on your terms.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="brisa-product-area-info__panel brisa-product-area-info__panel--install">
      <h2 class="brisa-product-area-info__script-heading">HOW TO<br><span>INSTALL</span></h2>
      <p class="brisa-product-area-info__panel-subheading">Three steps. Less than ten seconds.</p>

      <div class="brisa-product-area-info__steps">
        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__step">
          <span>01</span>
          <p><strong>Twist open</strong> Unscrew the top of your Better Unit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__step">
          <span>02</span>
          <p><strong>Slot the core in</strong> Drop the new core into the chamber.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__step">
          <span>03</span>
          <p><strong>Twist closed &amp; draw</strong> The ritual is back. Same motion, fresh flavour.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% liquid
        assign landscape_video_src = ''
        assign landscape_video_type = ''
        assign landscape_poster = section.settings.landscape_image

        if landscape_poster == blank and section.settings.landscape_local_video != blank
          assign landscape_poster = section.settings.landscape_local_video.preview_image
        endif

        if section.settings.landscape_local_video != blank
          assign landscape_local_source = section.settings.landscape_local_video.sources | where: 'format', 'mp4' | first
          if landscape_local_source == blank
            assign landscape_local_source = section.settings.landscape_local_video.sources | first
          endif
          assign landscape_video_src = landscape_local_source.url
          assign landscape_video_type = 'html5'
        elsif section.settings.landscape_video.type == 'youtube'
          assign landscape_video_src = 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/' | append: section.settings.landscape_video.id | append: '?autoplay=1&rel=0&modestbranding=1'
          assign landscape_video_type = 'iframe'
        elsif section.settings.landscape_video.type == 'vimeo'
          assign landscape_video_src = 'https://player.vimeo.com/video/' | append: section.settings.landscape_video.id | append: '?autoplay=1&title=0&byline=0&portrait=0'
          assign landscape_video_type = 'iframe'
        endif
      %}

      {% if landscape_video_src != blank or landscape_poster != blank %}
        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__landscape">
          {% if landscape_video_src != blank %}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="brisa-product-area-info__landscape-trigger"
              data-brisa-video-src="{{ landscape_video_src | escape }}"
              data-brisa-video-type="{{ landscape_video_type }}"
              data-brisa-video-aspect="portrait"
              aria-label="{{ section.settings.landscape_video_label | default: 'Play install video' | escape }}"
            >
              {% if landscape_poster != blank %}
                <img
                  src="{{ landscape_poster | image_url: width: 900 }}"
                  alt="{{ landscape_poster.alt | default: section.settings.landscape_video_label | default: 'Brisa install video' | escape }}"
                  class="brisa-product-area-info__landscape-image"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ landscape_poster.width }}"
                  height="{{ landscape_poster.height }}"
                >
              {% endif %}

              <span class="brisa-product-area-info__play" aria-hidden="true">
                <span></span>
              </span>
            </button>
          {% elsif landscape_poster != blank %}
            <img
              src="{{ landscape_poster | image_url: width: 900 }}"
              alt="{{ landscape_poster.alt | default: 'Brisa install video' | escape }}"
              class="brisa-product-area-info__landscape-image"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ landscape_poster.width }}"
              height="{{ landscape_poster.height }}"
            >
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="brisa-product-area-info__starter">
      <h2>NEW TO BRISA?</h2>
      <p>Cores need a Better Unit to slot into. Grab the Starter Kit and you'll get your device, 3 mini-cores (30 days), a cleaning kit, a 30-day bag, all for $130.</p>
      <a href="/products/starter-kit" class="brisa-product-area-info__button">GET THE STARTER KIT</a>
    </div>

    <div class="brisa-product-area-info__cost">
      <h2 class="brisa-product-area-info__heading">YOU'RE NOT BROKE.<br>YOU JUST VAPE.</h2>

      <div class="brisa-product-area-info__rows">
        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__row">
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__amount">$4,600</span>
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__label">a year</span>
        </div>
        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__row">
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__amount">$20,000</span>
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__label">by 2030</span>
        </div>
        <div class="brisa-product-area-info__row">
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__amount brisa-product-area-info__amount--highlight">$130</span>
          <span class="brisa-product-area-info__label">to start with Brisa</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Brisa product area info",
  "class": "shopify-section--brisa-product-area-info",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "landscape_image",
      "label": "Video poster",
      "info": "Portrait image shown before the video plays."
    },
    {
      "type": "video",
      "id": "landscape_local_video",
      "label": "Local video",
      "info": "Portrait video from Shopify Files. Replaces the external video if both are set."
    },
    {
      "type": "video_url",
      "id": "landscape_video",
      "label": "External video",
      "accept": ["youtube", "vimeo"]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "landscape_video_label",
      "label": "Video accessibility label",
      "default": "Play install video"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Brisa product area info",
      "category": "Brisa"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
